WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:16.058
We got five minutes to go over&nbsp;
all of American history.

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:18.769
Wiped out the indigenous&nbsp;
people, oppressed the blacks,

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.687
did some good stuff&nbsp;
around World War II,

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:22.689
and now the sun is setting
on our empire.

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:23.982
I guess we covered it all.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.068
No one teaches history&nbsp;
like I do.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.986
That's why I let you slide&nbsp;
with the dress code.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.614
You can't hide these calves&nbsp;
from the rest of the world.

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:32.866
I can't get my leg off.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.826
-Look at these.
-You're being expelled.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.662
So many have turned&nbsp;
their backs on these kids,

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.080
and I don't want to be
one of them.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:39.790
We're not turning our backs
on them,

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.959
it's turning our faces
to the good students.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:44.461
I am a mess inside.

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:46.838
Do you have any idea&nbsp;
how much pressure there is

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:48.507
on a young black man&nbsp;
to act like he knows

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.591
how to handle the ladies?

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:52.386
Michael B. Jordan
has ruined it for the rest of us.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:54.137
Mario Lopez did that&nbsp;
for my people.

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:55.305
Viva Iglesias!&nbsp;

00:00:55.389 --> 00:00:56.848
You clearly don't understand

00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:58.600
what it's like&nbsp;
for first-generation Latina

00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:00.644
-growing up in this country.
-I've seen Selena.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.355
Bling-bling,
shine bright like a diamond!

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.401
I've been working to close&nbsp;
the gap between the haves

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:08.860
and the have-nots.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:10.195
Have you had any luck?

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:11.280
I have not.

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.075
I will make this
an elite 100 school

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.702
by any means necessary.

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:17.619
I know that quote.

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.454
Civil rights activist
Malcolm Ten.

00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:22.207
-What?
-Wakanda forever.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.921
Mr. Iglesias saved the day!

00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:30.090
We love him and his hat!

